Error [jet.UnknownLoopLabel]: No loop labeled `missing` is in scope
  --> Tests/UI/loop_label_not_in_scope.jet:2:34
    |
  2 |     outer: loop i in [1, 2, 3] { break(missing) }
    |                                  ^^^^^
 Why: A named `break`/`next` must name an enclosing `name: loop`
 Fix: Use a label in scope: `break(outer)` or `next(outer)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0987
